---
// Mini Preview: form（表单）-- 纯静态，零 JS，Gallery/Stream 用
---
<div class="w-full aspect-[16/9] bg-canvas border border-line rounded-card overflow-hidden p-4 flex items-center justify-center">
  <div class="w-3/4 card-surface rounded-control p-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
    <div class="h-2 w-1/3 rounded-full bg-accent"></div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
      <label class="text-[9px] text-muted">邮箱地址</label>
      <div class="h-7 rounded-control border border-line bg-white px-2.5 flex items-center text-[10px] text-muted">you@example.com</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-1">
      <label class="text-[9px] text-muted">密码</label>
      <div class="h-7 rounded-control border border-line bg-white px-2.5 flex items-center text-[10px] text-muted">••••••••</div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[9px] text-muted">
        <span class="w-3.5 h-3.5 rounded border border-line bg-white inline-block"></span>
        记住我
      </span>
      <span class="text-[9px] text-accent">忘记密码？</span>
    </div>
    <span class="btn btn--primary rounded-control py-1.5 text-[11px] text-center">登录</span>
  </div>
</div>